abstract={This study aims to develop a Python programming learning chatbot system that integrates artificial intelligence and adaptive learning. By engaging with the chatbot, students can address programming-related challenges in real-time, enhancing their efficiency in learning programming. The system employs the Proximal Policy Optimization (PPO) reinforcement learning algorithm, enabling the chatbot to discern students' learning needs and provide tailored guidance during interactions. This personalized approach allows students to learn Python in a manner that suits their individual styles and paces. Ultimately, we anticipate that the proposed system will enrich the learning experience, increase learners' motivation, and improve their academic outcomes.},
